 "sentences": [
  "Your immune system fights off splinters.",
  "It works like a biological network protecting you from diseases.",
  "The system detects viruses, bacteria, and even cancer cells.",
  "It accurately distinguishes these threats from your own healthy tissue.",
  "Many species use two major subsystems.",
  "The innate system reacts broadly, while the adaptive system learns to recognize specific molecules.",
  "Nearly all organisms have some kind of immune defense."
